{"reference":"Genesis 12","book":"Genesis","chapter":12,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"historical_context","title":"Abram's call","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Genesis 12:1–3 links God's call of Abram with land, a great name and nation, blessing, and blessing for all the families of the earth. The chapter's opening call is therefore framed by both a particular promise to Abram and an outward-looking statement about the families of the earth.","verse_refs":["Genesis 12:1-3"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_genesis_012_b805260e3d0f4aa5817ebf03"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}
